\fs48 \cf2 \cb1 Part 2 \'97 Constitutional monetary requirements\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The following requirements are non-negotiable.\
The developer must not:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Peg MTQ \uc0\u931  to USD or treat USD as its permanent reference value.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Replace the governed currency-and-gold reference basket with a USD peg.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Confuse reference-index weights with reserve-portfolio weights.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Change MTQ \uc0\u931 's purchasing-power definition without explicit governance approval.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Allow MASE or MARP to bypass governance, authorization, oracle, reserve-solvency, or execution controls.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Introduce a competing rebalancing engine.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Treat oracle spot prices as executable route prices.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Count the same fee twice or omit an execution cost because of an inconsistent data source.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Treat simulated fills as evidence of real execution quality.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Treat a reserve ratio as a guarantee of redemption at the reference-index value.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	11	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Claim that a successful test, audit report, or passage of time automatically authorizes production.\
\ls7\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	12	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Allow the developer to invent objective functions, risk coefficients, threshold policies, price sources, or emergency exceptions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 USD-equivalent values may be used as a common accounting numeraire to compare heterogeneous costs and benefits. That accounting convention does not make MTQ \uc0\u931  USD-pegged.\
The governed reference index, the reserve portfolio, and the execution system are three different systems:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls8\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reference index \'97 the governed measurement of MTQ \uc0\u931 's purchasing-power reference.\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reserve portfolio \'97 the actual assets and liabilities, subject to reserve policy, liquidity, market risk, and redemption arrangements.\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Execution system \'97 determines whether a specific proposed transaction is economically justified and operationally safe.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 A correct rebalancing algorithm must not silently equate these three concepts.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \cb4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs48 \cf2 \cb1 Part 3 \'97 MARP architecture and execution protection\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs44 \cf2 3.1 Separation of responsibilities\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 MASE calculates the proposed reserve target under the approved methodology.\
MARP evaluates whether and how an approved target should be approached through executable transactions.\
The architecture must separate these stages:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reference-index calculation.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reserve valuation and holdings reconciliation.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Target-weight computation.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Trade sizing and direction.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Executable route quotation.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Estimated cost and adverse-movement protection.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	7	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Economic eligibility.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	8	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Authorization and on-chain hard-bound enforcement.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	9	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Execution.\
\ls9\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	10	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Settlement reconciliation and calibration.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 MASE must not execute trades. MARP must not rewrite the governed index. Neither component may bypass the authorization layer.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs44 \cf2 3.2 Five separate time measurements\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 Implement and record all five. Do not collapse these into a single "freshness" flag.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Oracle observation age \'97 current time minus the oracle observation timestamp.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Executable-quote age \'97 current time minus the quote's creation timestamp.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Decision-to-submission delay \'97 submission time minus decision time.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Submission-to-execution delay \'97 execution/inclusion time minus submission time, where observable.\
\ls10\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Settlement/finality delay \'97 finality time minus execution/inclusion time.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Each measurement requires a defined clock, units, data source, maximum permitted value, and failure behavior. If a value is not observable or reliable on a particular chain, label it unavailable and apply the approved conservative policy. Do not substitute zero.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

