These are not enhancements or nice-to-haves. A developer who implements only v5.0 will produce a system with reentrancy exposure, silent precision loss in slippage calculations, no path to recover stuck tokens, undefined behavior on multi-leg route failure, and no formal invariants to detect silent corruption.\
