\f1\fs28 \cb5 amountIn
\f0\fs32 \cb1  to the aggregator, approve exactly 
\f1\fs28 \cb5 amountIn
\f0\fs32 \cb1 , then reset to zero after the swap. If gas cost is prohibitive and a design decision to use infinite approvals is approved, document it and list it as an open decision.\
\ls48\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
