\fs32 \cf2 Document ID: MTQSIGMA-SINGLE-SOURCE-OF-TRUTH-006-EXT-2\uc0\u8232 Version: 5.2 \'97 Reserve, Governance, Oracle, MEV, and Operational Extensions\u8232 Date: 19 October 2026\u8232 Appends to: MTQSIGMA-SINGLE-SOURCE-OF-TRUTH-006 (v5.0) + MTQSIGMA-SINGLE-SOURCE-OF-TRUTH-006-EXT-1 (v5.1)\u8232 Status: Extends v5.0 and Extension 1. Any conflict is resolved by the six-level authority hierarchy in v5.0 \'a70.2.\
