\fs44 \cf2 \cb1 A.8 Vulnerability disclosure policy is missing (Gate 5 requirement)\
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\fs32 \cf2 The gap: A financial protocol will attract security researchers. Without a disclosure policy:\
\pard\intbl\itap2\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls145\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Researchers have no safe channel to report critical bugs.\
\ls145\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Disclosure timing is undefined.\
\ls145\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Bounty structure is undefined.\
\ls145\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Legal protections for good-faith researchers are undefined.\
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 This is standard practice for any deployed financial protocol. Its absence is a legal and security risk.\
What must be specified:\
\pard\intbl\itap2\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls146\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Disclosure channel: e.g., 
\f1\fs28 \cb5 security@mtq.example
\f0\fs32 \cb1  or a PGP key.\
\ls146\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Response SLA: e.g., acknowledge within 24 hours, triage within 72 hours.\
\ls146\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Disclosure timeline: e.g., public disclosure after fix or 90 days, whichever comes first.\
\ls146\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Safe harbor: clear statement that good-faith research is authorized and protected.\
\ls146\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Bounty scope and amounts: what's in scope (contracts, oracles, keeper, frontend), what's out of scope, bounty structure (Severity \'d7 percentage of funds at risk, or fixed amounts).\
\ls146\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Bug bounty program: Immunefi, Code4rena, or self-hosted.\
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Without this, Gate 5 should not open. Gate 2 (testnet) can proceed, but the moment the project announces itself publicly, the policy must exist.\
Required: OD-38 \'97 Publish vulnerability disclosure policy before any public announcement of the deployment.\
Owner: Security lead + Legal. Blocks: Gate 5 (not Gate 2, but should exist before any public-facing statement).\
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \cb4 \
\pard\intbl\itap2\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

